    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the Weirdest, Deadliest Spellcaster Ever</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a wizard with a problem: monsters keep trying to turn you into a stain on the dungeon floor. The solution? Stick magic parts onto yourself until they become the stain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Hordes. Try Not to Die. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of enemies who <i>probably</i> deserve it. Outsmart them with clever positioning, overpower them with absurd builds, or just panic and attach every part you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Fast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just having a good Synergy isn't enough. You'll have to execute on it if you want to succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Mayhem in Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Playthrough and Synergy provides a new way of playing the game, creating unique situations and new game-breaking Combinations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the Weirdest, Deadliest Spellcaster Ever</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a wizard with a problem: monsters keep trying to turn you into a stain on the dungeon floor. The solution? Stick magic parts onto yourself until they become the stain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Hordes. Try Not to Die. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of enemies who <i>probably</i> deserve it. Outsmart them with clever positioning, overpower them with absurd builds, or just panic and attach every part you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Fast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just having a good Synergy isn't enough. You'll have to execute on it if you want to succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Mayhem in Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Playthrough and Synergy provides a new way of playing the game, creating unique situations and new game-breaking Combinations.</p>",
